hts. I tell them what the Church teaches: suffering brings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"If you are weary, traveller, come in and sit. Many come to light candles of late; the chapel is brighter than it used to be.","zh":"旅人，若是累了，便进来坐坐。近来点烛的人多，堂里倒比往日亮些。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Giles Hayhold","zh":"贾尔斯·草堡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine","x":19,"y":14},"facing":"down","props":{"age":34,"household":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.h0","purse":4,"favourite":"item/misc/flute"},"contents":["tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1.coin0","tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1.coin1","tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1.coin2","tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1.coin3"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.cropped","face":"face.bright","hat":"hat.cap","outfit":"outfit.tunic","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"honey","eyes":"bark","hat.1":"russet","outfit.1":"rose","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":7,"map":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine","x":19,"y":14,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine","x":17,"y":9,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine","x":19,"y":14,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine","x":17,"y":9,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine","x":19,"y":14,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.chaffwick-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.chaffwic